        "effect": "The triggering creature sees themselves enjoying their deepest desires in the mirror's reflection, becoming fascinated (Will DC 20 negates). This fascination ends automatically when the mirror is broken or covered up.",
        "name": "Tempt",
        "subtype": "ability",
        "traits": [
          {
            "edition": "legacy",
            "game-id": "67a22784fdff12403013a5af60fb8621",
            "game-obj": "Traits",
            "name": "Enchantment",
